<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>UMER COMPUTERS - Under Maintenance</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --blue: #0b4fd6;
    --blue-dark: #07318a;
    --blue-soft: #e8f0ff;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --ink: #10213f;
    --muted: #5a6b8c;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html, body { height: 100%; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Sora', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--white);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .topbar {
    background: var(--blue);
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 22px 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .brand {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 2.6rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }
  main {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--blue-soft) 0%, var(--white) 70%);
  }
  .card {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 2px solid var(--blue);
    border-radius: 18px;
    max-width: 640px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: clamp(28px, 6vw, 56px);
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(11, 79, 214, 0.15);
  }
  .gear {
    width: 76px;
    height: 76px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    color: var(--blue);
    animation: spin 8s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4.5vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--blue-dark);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  p.lead {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 46ch;
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
  }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: var(--white);
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 10px 22px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .contact {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--blue-soft);
    padding-top: 24px;
  }
  .contact span {
    display: block;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .contact a {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 4vw, 1.6rem);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .contact a:hover, .contact a:focus-visible { text-decoration: underline; }
  .contact small {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 6px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  footer {
    background: var(--blue-dark);
    color: var(--white);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .gear { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="topbar">
  <div class="brand">UMER COMPUTERS</div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="card">
    <svg class="gear" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
      <path d="M19.4 15a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 .3 1.8l.1.1a2 2 0 1 1-2.8 2.8l-.1-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.8-.3 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1 1.5V21a2 2 0 1 1-4 0v-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.1-1.5 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.8.3l-.1.1a2 2 0 1 1-2.8-2.8l.1-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 .3-1.8 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.5-1H3a2 2 0 1 1 0-4h.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.5-1.1 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-.3-1.8l-.1-.1a2 2 0 1 1 2.8-2.8l.1.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.8.3H9a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1-1.5V3a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1 1.5 1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.8-.3l.1-.1a2 2 0 1 1 2.8 2.8l-.1.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-.3 1.8V9a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.5 1H21a2 2 0 1 1 0 4h-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.5 1z"/>
    </svg>

    <h1>Website is under maintenance</h1>
    <p class="lead">Please wait, our website will be live again in 24 hours. Thank you for your patience.</p>
    <div class="badge">Back online within 24 hrs</div>

    <div class="contact">
      <span>Contact us anytime</span>
      <a href="https://wa.me/923095827984">+92 309 5827984</a>
      <small>WhatsApp &amp; Support</small>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>&copy; UMER COMPUTERS. All rights reserved.</footer>

</body>
</html>
